  "profile": {
    "bio": "I am a UI/UX Designer and Writer based in Dhaka, Bangladesh, currently working full-time at SJ Innovation. Beyond design systems and creative technology, I find grounding in literature, writing poetry, exploring cinema, and spending meaningful time with family. My roots are in Munshiganj and Dhaka, shaped by deep cultural values, empathy, and intellectual curiosity.\n\nMy life philosophy centers on honesty, quiet focus, and continuous growth. I value open communication, shared humor, and mutual respect. I am looking for a companion who appreciates warmth, emotional intelligence, and values—someone with whom life feels like a thoughtful, supportive partnership.",
    "faq": [
      {
        "answer": "5 feet 8 inches. I'm tired of people lying about their heights or dick size, I personally find it pathetic. I am 5'8\" naturally, and when wearing shoes perhaps 1 or 2 more inches are added. Furthermore, I don't think I'm tall. 5'10\" is tall. I'm above average height.",
